{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾經歷合約糾紛的25歲日本女星森七菜，近年憑參演賣座電影《國寶》，令演藝事業反彈。日前，她與真人片《驀然回首》女星蒔田彩珠現身東京，宣傳兩人合演的串流劇《地雷固力果》。</p><p>當日，森七菜穿下黃色格仔連身裙，大晒香肩。她在劇中飾演女高中生，為爭奪校慶場地，挑戰各種不會死亡的遊戲，鬥智又鬥力。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T15:50:00.438164+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T15:03:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:31.173442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:03.987615+00:00","content_hash":"0ee99fd8f349a41fe687394c020572e0afadd1291b2dd84becac119f68e1e55b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T15:50:00.438164+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}